```php
use Commerz\Pricing\Facades\Pricing;   // корень Commerz\Pricing\Pricing: priceLists(): PriceLists, prices(): Prices, taxes(): Taxes

$list = Pricing::priceLists()->create(new CreatePriceList(
    code: 'retail', name: 'Розница', currency: Currency::of('RUB'), channels: [$channel->id],
    priority: 0, taxInclusion: TaxInclusion::AsChannel,
));
Pricing::prices()->set(new SetPrice(
    priceList: $list->id, sellable: SellableRef::of('variant', $v->id),
    amount: Money::of('1990.00', 'RUB'), compareAt: Money::of('2490.00', 'RUB'),
    minQuantity: 1, customerGroup: null, validFrom: null, validUntil: null,
));                                                        // PriceView; повтор того же ключа и окна — обновление суммы
Pricing::prices()->setMany(new SetPrices($list->id, [/* SetPrice… */]));
Pricing::prices()->reschedule(new ReschedulePrice($priceId, validFrom: null, validUntil: $at));
Pricing::prices()->remove(new RemovePrice($priceId));
Pricing::prices()->list(new ListPrices(priceList: $list->id, sellable: null, cursor: null, limit: 50));   // Page<PriceView>
[$price] = Pricing::prices()->resolveMany([new ResolvePrice(SellableRef::of('variant', $v->id), quantity: 2)], $ctx); // = порт PriceResolver
$why = Pricing::prices()->explain(new ExplainPrice(SellableRef::of('variant', $v->id), quantity: 2, context: $ctx)); // PriceExplanation

Pricing::taxes()->defineClass(new DefineTaxClass(code: 'standard', name: 'Стандартная'));
Pricing::taxes()->defineZone(new DefineTaxZone(code: 'ru', name: 'Россия', members: [new TaxZoneMember('RU')]));
Pricing::taxes()->setRate(new SetTaxRate(taxClass: 'standard', zone: 'ru', rateBp: 2200, code: 'vat', validFrom: new DateTimeImmutable('2026-01-01T00:00:00Z')));
Pricing::taxes()->zoneFor(new Address('RU', 'RU-MOW'));  // ?TaxZoneView
```
- Отличия от knowledge/api-blueprint#pricing (фиксируются deviation в P4.7): `CreatePriceList` получает `name`, `priority`, `taxInclusion`; `SetTaxRate(zone: 'ru')` — код зоны, а не страны (зона = набор стран/регионов); разрешение — `resolveMany` (сигнатура порта ядра) плюс `explain` вместо `resolve(..., context)` с «причиной» в одном DTO; `ResolvePrice` — тип ядра `Commerz\Ports\Prices\Data\ResolvePrice` (без context).
- Views: `PriceListView(id, code, name, currency, priority, TaxInclusion taxInclusion, status, list<ChannelId> channels, createdAt, updatedAt)`, `PriceView(id, priceList, sellable, ?customerGroup, minQuantity, amount, ?compareAt, ?validFrom, ?validUntil, createdAt, updatedAt)`, `TaxClassView(id, code, name)`, `TaxZoneView(id, code, name, list<TaxZoneMember> members)`, `TaxRateView(id, taxClass code, zone code, code, Rate rate, ?validFrom, ?validUntil)`.
- Исключения (подклассы ядра: NotFound / Conflict / InvalidCommand), стабильные коды: `pricing.price_list_not_found`, `pricing.price_list_archived`, `pricing.price_not_found` (по id; не путать с `prices.price_not_found` ядра), `pricing.price_window_overlap`, `pricing.duplicate_code`, `pricing.currency_mismatch`, `pricing.tax_class_not_found`, `pricing.tax_zone_not_found`, `pricing.tax_rate_not_found`, `pricing.tax_rate_overlap`, `pricing.tax_zone_member_taken`, `pricing.invalid_tax_result`, формы — `pricing.invalid_*`.
- События (после коммита, `CommittedEvents`): `PriceListChanged(PriceListId)`, `PricesChanged(PriceListId, list<string> sellables)`, `TaxRatesChanged(string taxClass, string zone)`. Outbox не используется (нет межпакетного потребителя в 0.1).
